@startuml "overview.puml"
left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
class "LogHub (public facade)" as Hub
class PipelineDirector
interface IPipelineConstruction
class StandardPipelineBuilder
class PipelineBuilder
class CompositionRoot
class BuiltPipeline
class LogHubApplication
class ProfileCatalog
class LogConfiguration
abstract class LogImporterFactory
interface ILogImporter
abstract class LogFamilyFactory
class FamilyComponents
interface ILogSink
class SinkDecoration
interface ILogRule
class RuleParser
class LogProcessor
class LogFlowMediator
class ImportSession
class ProcessingPipeline
class PipelineEvents
class PipelineSubscriptions
class PipelineSinkLifetime
Hub ..> ProfileCatalog : default prototype
ProfileCatalog --> LogConfiguration : deep-cloned profiles
Hub ..> PipelineDirector : classic
Hub ..> PipelineBuilder : fluent
PipelineDirector --> IPipelineConstruction
IPipelineConstruction <|.. StandardPipelineBuilder
StandardPipelineBuilder --> PipelineBuilder : shared construction steps
PipelineBuilder ..> CompositionRoot : validated plan
CompositionRoot ..> LogImporterFactory : select creator
LogImporterFactory ..> ILogImporter : factory method
CompositionRoot ..> LogFamilyFactory : select family
LogFamilyFactory ..> FamilyComponents : compatible output/storage/format
CompositionRoot ..> SinkDecoration : configure outer-to-inner wrappers
SinkDecoration ..> ILogSink : decorated target
CompositionRoot ..> RuleParser
RuleParser ..> ILogRule : expression tree
CompositionRoot ..> BuiltPipeline : container-owned product
BuiltPipeline --> LogHubApplication
LogHubApplication --> LogProcessor
LogHubApplication --> PipelineSinkLifetime : flush before summary
LogProcessor --> LogFlowMediator
LogFlowMediator --> ImportSession
LogFlowMediator --> ProcessingPipeline
ImportSession --> ILogImporter
ProcessingPipeline --> PipelineEvents
ProcessingPipeline --> PipelineSubscriptions
PipelineSubscriptions ..> ILogSink : via SinkObserver
PipelineSinkLifetime --> ILogSink : owns receiver trees
PipelineSinkLifetime --> PipelineEvents : final flush errors
note bottom of ProcessingPipeline
  Existing LR4 chain + visitors + observers are preserved.
  CompositeRuleFilter adds an ILogRule to the same chain.
  Production storage: virtual proxy -> SQL adapter -> SQLite.
end note
@enduml
